{"kind":"rss","id":"wxmp:channel:gh_e90381c38164","title":"ADLab","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzk1NzE0ODUyOA==&mid=2247493159&idx=1&sn=1c05a0703808930d46b733602ad8571b&chksm=c290e9a5bfbb5abe501defcb8176df89334753b79fb3bdf8d3f9e37646786a0612525cf51ae5&scene=126&sessionid=1795076144#rd","description":"启明星辰积极防御实验室（ADLab）成立于1999年，秉承维护国家网络安全、提升集团安全能力、培养攻防技术人员为己任，以攻防实战能力为导向，聚焦漏洞安全、高级威胁、攻防技术研究，持续积累攻防资源，完善攻防体系。","language":"zh-cn","extra":{"view":"timeline","show_thumbnails":true,"proxy_images":true,"headers":{"referer":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"tags":["微信公众号"]},"author":{"name":"ADLab","uri":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx.qlogo.cn%2Fmmhead%2Fk947icPboBqD69NUqeHw0CCDS0PkXWCeAcTibMPpYKyVCY0THMVIyRMuA466jjTKSrokUd1Dn34LE%2F0","updated":"2026-11-18T10:31:58.000Z","items":[{"id":"wxmp:Mzk1NzE0ODUyOA%3D%3D:2247493159:1","title":"【复现】Java4Shell JavaOpenJDK AVX-512 Base64堆溢出漏洞（CVE-2026-114938）","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzk1NzE0ODUyOA==&mid=2247493159&idx=1&sn=1c05a0703808930d46b733602ad8571b&chksm=c290e9a5bfbb5abe501defcb8176df89334753b79fb3bdf8d3f9e37646786a0612525cf51ae5&scene=126&sessionid=1795076144#rd","description":"OpenJDK官方发布紧急安全更新，披露并修复了HotSpot JVM Base64解码路径存在的内存破坏漏洞（CVE-2026-114938），该漏洞CVSS 4.0评分9.2。该漏洞由安全研究团队 Calif发现并披露，并被命名为Java4Shell。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Fd1YpVG2tPVrfrwtX6kAGibbLenyHL3NIhBRKtSyH6ibibxmoiaDiaVPxibziaAib6GIhj5IodJicRLJicTRSteic0bujDd3WM2Pwjx7XWpQ7EGMyv6pibWY%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-18T10:31:58.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzk1NzE0ODUyOA%3D%3D:2247493152:1","title":"【复现】Apache HTTP Server mod_http2竞态条件堆破坏漏洞（CVE-2026-119618）","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzk1NzE0ODUyOA==&mid=2247493152&idx=1&sn=f768857830bc9233bab13ab84f44b3f8&chksm=c20d37f9097b8d18ae0f45885623dc368a67f5ecc9076437038f3d101d6402ccd145349b94e5&scene=126&sessionid=1795076144#rd","description":"Apache官方发布httpd 2.4.71安全更新，披露并修复了Apache HTTP Server mod_http2模块存在的竞态条件堆破坏漏洞（CVE-2026-119618），该漏洞CVSS 3.1评分9.8。由于该漏洞技术细节已公开，攻击利用可能性较高，对于使用该服务的组织而言构成直接且严重的风险。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Fd1YpVG2tPVpe7ic79icIt2NraRXcMQ2NOefrbe9cFc1YVRfEso9zZoymKeCpicBhibDJvGny75Gia8qN4q1tKD5bbzjvP9oN5dtDBs9vmIibibTe28%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-17T09:04:33.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzk1NzE0ODUyOA%3D%3D:2247493145:1","title":"【ADLab原创漏洞】Samsung MediaProvider跨用户及任意文件读写高危漏洞","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzk1NzE0ODUyOA==&mid=2247493145&idx=1&sn=7ffe906824716d2da8feabe992c61ad9&chksm=c282b9e85b4f5b9b6b48a83e82da4b73e3ca5ca724114dd46f8ecfaeaafad049683135959fe2&scene=126&sessionid=1795076144#rd","description":"启明星辰ADLab通过对Samsung定制版MediaProvider的多用户与文件交互机制开展安全审计，重点排查公开暴露且持有系统级特权的ContentProvider，发现其OTG处理逻辑存在严重的任意文件读写及跨用户资源窃取漏洞。Samsung官方已发布S9210CHC6DZH3版本修复该漏洞。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Fd1YpVG2tPVqJc0QjNMSrPTo0HPFlcda2e1KxkvHy8Rul6v8fVCf1tOo52QqBNIyFqoiaYXSNPAzkxbI8oCP18yIziavtzyT4b6XPI0fvGXiaGg%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-10T10:04:30.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzk1NzE0ODUyOA%3D%3D:2247493138:1","title":"【复现】OpenSSH musl libc密码认证绕过漏洞（CVE-2026-123158）","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzk1NzE0ODUyOA==&mid=2247493138&idx=1&sn=a593440bc06e6d9ca74367cd47d3ccca&chksm=c26c95d3edcdcf17aa82c815616f9f5c1b89210bc2864cb3e65aa1db9a33bda173cf3898cef2&scene=126&sessionid=1795076144#rd","description":"OpenSSH Portable是其面向Linux等平台的可移植版本，sshd的密码认证实现是本次漏洞的主要影响面；该问题主要影响采用musl libc的轻量级发行版与容器基础镜像。OpenSSH官方发布10.6p2 安全更新，修复了OpenSSH Portable在musl libc环境下的密码认证绕过漏洞。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fd1YpVG2tPVrOsdbncVKejkcmFP9yYr1iaXPClaavKTV8xyPmRFYLomZ0vAk4BS6MR6PH0MODeHXZVGKNbe7pxibEibCCzCanRP0aXLw9GiaMKjg%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-09T09:41:42.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzk1NzE0ODUyOA%3D%3D:2247493131:1","title":"【复现】Linux内核IPv4 TCP释放后重用漏洞（CVE-2026-98432）","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzk1NzE0ODUyOA==&mid=2247493131&idx=1&sn=bd02b1c0f9e907318014ca89455bceef&chksm=c27bc61745336e92d769eba0d53fbd2cdfee86b51099a07022e2884cad8ccbe129afbdf55203&scene=126&sessionid=1795076144#rd","description":"近期，Linux内核CNA发布了Linux内核IPv4 TCP释放后重用漏洞CVE-2026-98432，CVSS 3.1 评分为 9.8 分；并进一步披露了针对MPTCP监听场景的利用演示。该漏洞在特定条件下（如 MPTCP 监听器）可实现远程任意代码执行并获取 root 权限。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fd1YpVG2tPVo2YVpVYiaYrdbUPIqNzBx39cOaW0fJhCoibkWktEEutzUrVPq6ICqrJfYXUWanuNia2prCqiagice8SiayzBmBDmSs5rlVgCftqamzM%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-05T09:52:23.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzk1NzE0ODUyOA%3D%3D:2247493107:1","title":"【复现】GitLab正则表达式编译器未授权远程代码执行漏洞（CVE-2026-97229）","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzk1NzE0ODUyOA==&mid=2247493107&idx=1&sn=1e519b843a09e0b1bb207d85360abedb&chksm=c2592b1956b582ba790da3e8f6b7ca7f2d923361387d8a74c5079c6cd475522f57ef54d3c6e7&scene=126&sessionid=1795076144#rd","description":"GitLab是全球广泛使用的DevOps平台。GitLab正则表达式编译器未授权远程代码执行漏洞（CVE-2026-97229）于2026年10月13日在NVD平台公开，CVSS 3.1评分10.0分。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fd1YpVG2tPVrJCwMIXphNdictDjsUeNkI0jVRibjib3twlAXSNCSeTRuJmowpIKTXbPvnSN5nvI7Q5EMZAHAACCPjtIhhUH3F4HzUsvH91XYkpM%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-10-16T09:33:16.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzk1NzE0ODUyOA%3D%3D:2247493099:1","title":"【复现】Atlassian 多产品未授权任意文件读取漏洞（CVE-2026-21589）","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzk1NzE0ODUyOA==&mid=2247493099&idx=1&sn=c8b276912ebdaa061825321ab31c2d91&chksm=c269447169adaf5e34845dff33ee001370ff2b5dc0f2974f8a8e86ff3469bf8c54ce2cfc6913&scene=126&sessionid=1795076144#rd","description":"CVE-2026-21589是Atlassian于2026年10月5日发布安全公告披露的任意文件访问（Arbitrary File Access/Read）漏洞，影响上述几乎所有Data Center产品的全部历史版本。该漏洞允许未认证攻击者读取Web应用根目录内的任意文件（含受保护的WEB-INF目录）。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fd1YpVG2tPVogXu57GoicgVsiaSw0e5oWnPqPnRaGqmpgA1ugpocIz5XxNAhu8CIjKOyqj7t1G9Qotz2724nQic5HtKzBsJPoA33f6b5VNrIAGc%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-10-09T09:30:28.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzk1NzE0ODUyOA%3D%3D:2247493085:1","title":"AI Agent安全威胁与攻击能力演进研究—— 攻击能力扩张的新路径","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzk1NzE0ODUyOA==&mid=2247493085&idx=1&sn=da77bd2851ae656cb172fde2e0b5608f&chksm=c2a97c894878de4978186de125c225803ac576db6919d26243934c39ed91f5fea412e5423055&scene=126&sessionid=1795076144#rd","description":"本文将从攻击面、自主攻击能力、真实案例、防护措施和未来影响等方面展开分析，并重点讨论任务状态、外部知识、第三方能力、工具权限和运行时执行等环节，这些环节既是攻击者实施“能力借用”的具体对象，也是防御者设计检测点和干预点的关键入口。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Fd1YpVG2tPVoV8HZKbqAia73WwMNPKVt1obSB0VewTpwjDwFr9aD3iaOxeXGZVQr3kvuCRp15v72N5o5NmUYzzic4IyrEDpibZ9rBcLNXkMPankE%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-09-30T09:52:24.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzk1NzE0ODUyOA%3D%3D:2247493038:1","title":"启明星辰入选国家人工智能安全漏洞库首批技术支撑单位","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzk1NzE0ODUyOA==&mid=2247493038&idx=1&sn=a192cc63ccc98c684d56491f181019c4&chksm=c2fedb920fce26016431f74afff4f409c4b82ae3ef3097ff7357112f1f7a73d306b6f212ef5e&scene=126&sessionid=1795076144#rd","description":"启明星辰入选国家人工智能安全漏洞库首批技术支撑单位","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fd1YpVG2tPVoB0I5IPUskGUR18Jko0DNJ89iawRxiaXJbrKvbL76zNYgbdXBLfxGjk38uliburoontBZvaaHkc79mNjJSeXZB2L0byhTHFpZ0VM%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-09-25T02:32:52.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzk1NzE0ODUyOA%3D%3D:2247493033:1","title":"【复现】WordPress Comment2Shell零点击存储型XSS可导致RCE漏洞（CVE-2026-93485）","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzk1NzE0ODUyOA==&mid=2247493033&idx=1&sn=6cb3b5a5eae361c38aebe45d4b92f851&chksm=c288ae6dd231615c6d1384929272b6352e5d63164a0338721c76f2f182ff7473f238f76f4c1e&scene=126&sessionid=1795076144#rd","description":"WordPress是全球使用最广泛的开源内容管理系统（CMS）。CVE-2026-93485漏洞无需管理员点击任何链接或按钮，攻击者仅需向目标站点提交一条评论即可植入载荷；当具有插件安装权限的管理员加载包含该评论页面时，脚本会在其会话中执行并上传恶意插件，实现RCE。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fd1YpVG2tPVpicUic6bp9na5nxHclcPSDNRq4koibOKkhicOZc0jt3vUC56oXUEeFv1Lw81dSYp85LAibvv3cvwj9UhkPU4goz9Yfpdriatdj3meia0%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-09-23T09:50:52.000Z"}]}